   - **`countries` Table:**
     - `country_name`: This column contains the names of countries, which can be semantically enriched using embeddings.
   - **`years` Table:**
     - `year_description`: This column contains descriptions that may provide contextual information about the year.
   - **`causes_of_death` Table:**
